:false},{"title":"Junior Architect (Residential Projects)","company":"Archestra","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-08-03","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/junior-architect-residential-projects-job-in-coimbatore-at-archestra1785734217","experience":"2 year(s)","skills":[103],"walkin_time":"9:30 am to 6:30 pm","description":"**An architecture practice based in Tatbad, Coimbatore\\- is hiring a Junior Architect with 0\u20132 years of experience to support residential architecture projects. The role involves assisting with design development, technical documentation, consultant coordination, and project execution.** \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Project Exposure** \n\n\n\n\n\n Work may include:\n \n\n\n\n* Residential architecture projects\n* Residential interior projects\n* Custom home design\n* Design development\n* Construction documentation\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities** \n\n\n\n* Assist in developing architectural concepts, layouts, and design proposals.\n* Prepare presentation drawings, design development drawings, working drawings, and construction documentation.\n* Produce plans, elevations, sections, and architectural details.\n* Coordinate with structural, MEP, and other consultants during project development.\n* Support material selection and architectural detailing.\n* Coordinate with contractors, vendors, and project teams during execution.\n* Participate in site visits to review progress and support implementation of design intent.\n* Maintain project drawings and documentation throughout different project stages.\n* Support timely delivery of architectural documentation and project deliverables.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Requirements** \n\n\n\n* **Bachelor's degree in Architecture (B.Arch).**\n* **0\u20132 years of internship or professional experience in architecture.**\n* Proficiency in AutoCAD, SketchUp, and architectural presentation or visualization software.\n* Understanding of architectural planning, drafting, technical documentation, and detailing.\n* Familiarity with residential construction methods and building materials.\n* Ability to prepare presentation drawings, working drawings, and technical documentation.\n* Good communication and coordination skills.\n* Ability to work collaboratively with consultants, contractors, and project teams.\n* Attention to detail and ability to manage multiple project tasks.\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Work Schedule** \n\n\n\n* **Location:** \n\n \u00a0 Tatabad, Coimbatore\n* **Working days:** \n\n Monday to Saturday (9:30 am to 6:30 pm)"},{"title":"Telesales Executive","company":"Zimson - India","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-08-03","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-telesales-executive-job-in-coimbatore-at-zimson-india1785734425"},{"title":"Junior Telecaller","company":"Smart Stream Technologies","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-08-19","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/junior-telecaller-job-in-coimbatore-at-smart-stream-technologies1787145974","experience":"1 year(s)"},{"title":"Mechanical Engineering","company":"Mechinex","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-08-27","url":"https://internshala.com/internship/detail/mechanical-engineering-internship-in-coimbatore-at-mechinex1787814888"},{"title":"Community Specialist","company":"Spirezen Enterprises Private Limited","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-04","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-community-specialist-job-in-coimbatore-at-spirezen-enterprises-private-limited1788507190"},{"title":"Performance Marketer","company":"B-Tech Digital Agency","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-04","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-performance-marketer-job-in-coimbatore-at-b-tech-digital-agency1788507249"},{"title":"3D Printing Technician (Additive Manufacturing)","company":"TekPillar","location":"Coimbatore","date_posted":"2026-09-06","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/3d-printing-technician-additive-ma